  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: Initial release. [Mock(typeof(IFoo))] on a partial class generates a test double implementing the interface with per-member `*_Handler` delegates, `*_Calls` argument logs, and `*_CallCount`. Supports methods (sync, Task, Task<T>) and get/set properties. AM001 (target must be partial), AM002 (argument must be an interface type), AM003 (unsupported member: generic method, ref/out/in parameter, indexer, or event — skipped).",
